Z||000001||JohnF||11-04-2001||03:41 PM||||Get a Haynes Fiero manual an go to Chapter 12.  Exterior lights (including tail lights) and back up lights are covered there.  <P>How accurately, I can't guarantee.  See if this helps.||||reg||11
